# Example Remote S3 Backend Configuration with DynamoDB State Locking
# To use:
# 1. Create an S3 bucket (e.g., ticketdesk-tfstate-enterprise-poc)
# 2. Create a DynamoDB table with partition key 'LockID' (e.g., ticketdesk-tflocks)
# 3. Rename this file to backend.tf and run: terraform init -migrate-state

